OL,3,GNEWSASuspect tried to rape teen in
OL,4,Awoods next to school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl has escaped an attempted
OL,7,Frape after she was pushed into the
OL,8,Fwoods near a high school in Worcester,
OL,9,Fpolice say.
OL,11,FThe incident happened at about 08:15
OL,12,FGMT on Tuesday morning on a footpath
OL,13,Fbetween Nunnery Wood High School and
OL,14,Fthe Worcestershire Royal car park.
OL,16,FWest Mercia Police said the victim was
OL,17,Fapproached by the unknown man in the
OL,18,Fwoods, who then forced her further into
OL,19,Fthe trees, where he attempted to
OL,20,Fsexually assault her.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
