OL,3,GNEWSASuspect tried to rape teen in
OL,4,Awoods next to school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe girl managed to escape and find a
OL,7,Fdog walker who then called police. The
OL,8,Fsuspect is described by police as a
OL,9,Fmixed-race teenager - believed to be
OL,10,Fbetween 16 and 18 years of age - and
OL,11,Fwas wearing all black.
